---
import { BRAND } from '../lib/brand';
import { BUSINESS_CONTACT } from '../lib/businessContact';
import HelloFraandsPage from '../layouts/HelloFraandsPage.astro';
export const prerender = true;
---
<HelloFraandsPage updated="2026-10-14" title="About us" summary="Apne favourite influencer se private phone call, aapka number private.">
<h2>Talk to your favourite influencer</h2>
<p>{BRAND.name} connects you to your favourite social media influencer (YouTube, Instagram, Facebook and more) over a private phone call, paid by the minute. When you book a call, we first call the influencer and say that you want to talk. If the influencer accepts, we call you and join the two calls. Both calls come from a {BRAND.name} number, so your private number is never shared, and neither is the influencer's. The influencer sets the per-minute rate. No human monitors or listens to your call.</p>
<p>This is not professional advice, dating, therapy or a crisis line. Influencers offer conversation, not professional advice. Read our <a href="/disclaimer">service disclaimer</a> and <a href="/safety">safety centre</a>.</p>
<h2>Who runs {BRAND.name}</h2>
<dl><dt>Business name</dt><dd>{BUSINESS_CONTACT.name}</dd><dt>Public postal address</dt><dd>{BUSINESS_CONTACT.postalAddress}</dd><dt>Support</dt><dd><a href={`mailto:${BRAND.emails.support}`}>{BRAND.emails.support}</a></dd></dl>
<p>For complaints, use our <a href="/grievance">grievance process</a>.</p>
</HelloFraandsPage>
